{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"combo-s-nav","type":"text","text":"# 玩家普攻｜第04批代码冻结，专项回归通过\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|流程]]\n第二轮完整 C++ 构建已通过；第五次自动化中 Combo 两项与 MontageTask 共 3/3 通过且 0 warning，真实 Mesh、CVar 优先级与具体 lease owner 夹具已验证。GA/ABP/移动集成和完整动作验收待完成。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1510,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"combo-s-input","type":"text","text":"## 输入边界\nIA_Attack 已保存 Pressed，类型回读通过。\nASC::AbilitySpecInputPressed → WaitComboInput。\nHeroComponent 只缓存激活失败。\n[[Input/结构]]","x":0,"y":240,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"combo-s-ga","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\n管理段序、窗口与单请求缓存。\nSuper/Commit/Ready 返回校验本地激活代次。\nStartStep 校验段 token 与任务身份。\nEnd 在 Super 前清旧任务/Trace/Timer、恢复 Mesh。\nGA_Attack_Light 尚待改父类。","x":530,"y":240,"width":450,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-s-config","type":"text","text":"## FGGYGOComboStep[]\n原生结构已定义，蓝图默认值待配置。\nMontage、Main/End、NextStepIndex、PlayRate、Damage/PoiseDamage、Socket/Radius。\nValidateComboConfiguration → 校验配置。","x":1060,"y":240,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"combo-s-task","type":"text","text":"## Montage Task\nASC 执行播放，Task 持有资源与回调。\n固定原 AnimInstance/Character/播放实例。\n有效速率快照供 watchdog 使用。\nRootMotionScale 按 owner/token 恢复基线。\n测试夹具复用 UE 5.8 默认 Slot、真实 UAnimComposite segment 与带 render data 的引擎 Mesh；CVar 按原 SetBy 恢复。\n引擎嵌套播放写回限制见计划。","x":530,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-s-anim","type":"text","text":"## 三份独立 Main→End Montage\n资产、FullBody、窗口已保存回读。\nNotifyState → ComboWindowBegin/End。\nHitWindowBegin/End 独立。\nABP Slot 与 GA 默认值尚未接入。\n[[Animation/结构]]","x":1060,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"combo-s-hit","type":"text","text":"## Hero MeleeTrace / GE\nHeroCharacter 持有 MeleeTraceComponent。\n服务器 BeginTraceWindow → 清去重集合。\nOnMeleeHit → DamageEffect/Cue。\nEndTraceWindow → 停止扫掠。\nSocket/GE 配置与命中验证待完成。\n[[Combat/结构]]","x":0,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"combo-s-network","type":"text","text":"## 输入 / 强类型纠正\nWaitComboInput → 来源段、RequestId。\nASC ClientCorrectAbilityState → Spec/实例/key。\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData → 段/位置/窗口/Revision。\nCombo ReceiveAbilityCorrection → 类型与范围校验。\n旧接受不撤销新预测；本批联机待验。","x":530,"y":1040,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"5"}
	],
